The `cleanup` function cleans up the dynamically allocated memory and data source when necessary.

This implementation uses a mutex to synchronize access to the shared `records` array across multiple concurrent instances. The `update_data_source` function should be implemented to periodically update the offset and key arrays from an external data source, ensuring graceful degradation in case of network issues or data source unavailability.

